{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"ash_golem","model_identifier":"ash_golem","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# ash_golem\n\nAsh golem (C5, Deadlands), 3.5 m = 124 u to the top of the shoulder rocks (head top 110 u).\n\nA giant of cracked black rock: ash-flecked black stone with jagged molten-orange cracks all over, a head sunk forward under a heavy brow with burning eyes and a glowing maw, chest slabs split by a white-hot seam with a furnace glow in the belly, huge shoulder rocks, a back crag (`fx_smoke` on top for an ash plume), knee rocks, great stone fists with glowing knuckle seams (`fx_fist_r/l`). It hunts players until one side is dead. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (scaled).\n\n- Cubes: 36 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 512x512, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -50.0..50.0, y 0.0..124.0, z -26.0..22.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 100 x 120 x 50 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -4, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 2 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 1.1 | loop |  |\n| `attack_smash` | 1.9 | once | key 1.0 s: both fists smash down in front |\n| `ground_pound` | 2.6 | once | keys 1.2 and 1.8 s: two pounds into the ground in front (area hit, radius ~2.5 m around fx_fist_r/l) |\n| `aggro` | 2 | once | rears up and pounds the air |\n| `injured` | 0.8 | once | heavy flinch |\n| `death` | 2.4 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 39.1 u/s (1.10 m/s), cycle 2.0 s, 78.2 u per cycle\n- `run`: 113.8 u/s (3.20 m/s), cycle 1.1 s, 125.2 u per cycle (heavy lumbering run)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_smash`: key 1.0 s: both fists smash down in front\n- `ground_pound`: keys 1.2 and 1.8 s: two pounds into the ground in front (area hit, radius ~2.5 m around fx_fist_r/l)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 116, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 81, 17.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (12, 90.5, 17.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (20, 101.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 76.5, -17.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (36, 37, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-45.5, 60, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-36, 37, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (19, 55, 11.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-19, 55, 11.5)\n- `fx_smoke` on `torso` at (0, 118, 12)\n- `fx_fist_r` on `hand_r` at (36, 22, 0)\n- `fx_fist_l` on `hand_l` at (-36, 22, 0)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Lit cubes: glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l, glow_maw, glow_seam_*, glow_furnace (plus painted cracks).\n- Variant texture: ash_golem_cold.png (cooling, dimmer seams).\n"},"description":"# ash_golem\n\nAsh golem (C5, Deadlands), 3.5 m = 124 u to the top of the shoulder rocks (head top 110 u).\n\nA giant of cracked black rock: ash-flecked black stone with jagged molten-orange cracks all over, a head sunk forward under a heavy brow with burning eyes and a glowing maw, chest slabs split by a white-hot seam with a furnace glow in the belly, huge shoulder rocks, a back crag (`fx_smoke` on top for an ash plume), knee rocks, great stone fists with glowing knuckle seams (`fx_fist_r/l`). It hunts players until one side is dead. Baseline humanoid skeleton and slot names (scaled).\n\n- Cubes: 36 (all unrotated unless noted). Texture 512x512, 1 px per unit, embedded.\n- Rest bounds (body, no held items): x -50.0..50.0, y 0.0..124.0, z -26.0..22.0 (faces -Z).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- one box 100 x 120 x 50 (w x h x d), centred on x = 0, z = -4, from y = 0\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | notes |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `idle` | 4 | loop |  |\n| `walk` | 2 | loop |  |\n| `run` | 1.1 | loop |  |\n| `attack_smash` | 1.9 | once | key 1.0 s: both fists smash down in front |\n| `ground_pound` | 2.6 | once | keys 1.2 and 1.8 s: two pounds into the ground in front (area hit, radius ~2.5 m around fx_fist_r/l) |\n| `aggro` | 2 | once | rears up and pounds the air |\n| `injured` | 0.8 | once | heavy flinch |\n| `death` | 2.4 | hold | topples forward; holds; rests on y = 0 |\n\n## Move speeds (in-place cycles; stride matched to these)\n\n- `walk`: 39.1 u/s (1.10 m/s), cycle 2.0 s, 78.2 u per cycle\n- `run`: 113.8 u/s (3.20 m/s), cycle 1.1 s, 125.2 u per cycle (heavy lumbering run)\n\n## Key times\n\n- `attack_smash`: key 1.0 s: both fists smash down in front\n- `ground_pound`: keys 1.2 and 1.8 s: two pounds into the ground in front (area hit, radius ~2.5 m around fx_fist_r/l)\n\n## Attachment points (empty groups, pivot in model units)\n\n- `slot_head` on `head` at (0, 116, 0)\n- `slot_back` on `torso` at (0, 81, 17.5)\n- `slot_quiver` on `torso` at (12, 90.5, 17.5)\n- `slot_shoulder_r` on `torso` at (20, 101.5, 0)\n- `slot_carry` on `torso` at (0, 76.5, -17.5)\n- `slot_hand_r` on `hand_r` at (36, 37, 0)\n- `slot_shield_l` on `arm_lower_l` at (-45.5, 60, 0)\n- `slot_hand_l` on `hand_l` at (-36, 37, 0)\n- `slot_hip_r` on `hips` at (19, 55, 11.5)\n- `slot_hip_l` on `hips` at (-19, 55, 11.5)\n- `fx_smoke` on `torso` at (0, 118, 12)\n- `fx_fist_r` on `hand_r` at (36, 22, 0)\n- `fx_fist_l` on `hand_l` at (-36, 22, 0)\n\n## Notes\n\n- Lit cubes: glow_eye_r / glow_eye_l, glow_maw, glow_seam_*, glow_furnace (plus painted cracks).\n- Variant texture: ash_golem_cold.png (cooling, dimmer seams).\n","resolution":{"width":512,"height":512},"elements":[{"name":"pelvis","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-18.0,52.0,-12.0],"to":[18.0,60.0,12.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,52.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[170,159,206.0,167.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[242,159,266.0,167.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[206,159,242.0,167.0],"texture":0},"west":{"